  "all_ingredients_flat": "1 cup quinoa, 1 cup of seven different daals (beans of our choice), 1/2 tsp methi dana (fenugreek seeds), 3 tsp water, 1.5 cups of grated mixed veggies (bottle gourd, pumpkin, red onion, carrot, capsicum, beetroot), 1/4 tsp hing (asafetida), 1/2 tsp black pepper, 1 inch ginger (grated), 1 tsp sweetener (dates | maple syrup), some green chillies (to taste), 1/4 tsp pink salt (to taste), a few drops of lemon juice, 3-4 curry leaves (minced), 1 tsp ENO, mustard seeds, cumin seeds, curry leaves, sesame seeds, some crushed peanuts",
  "instructions": "BATTER\n- 1 cup quinoa, 1 cup of seven different daals (beans of our choice), 1/2 tsp methi dana (fenugreek seeds) – soak overnight, rinse well, add 3 tsp water, grind it & keep for 6 to 8 hours for fermentation.\n- Prepare 1.5 cups of grated mixed veggies of your choice. I used bottle gourd, pumpkin, red onion, carrot, capsicum, beetroot. Squeeze the juice out of grated veggies with hands to make them less watery – use this juice as a vegetable broth for another recipe.\n- Mix grated mixed vegetables with fermented batter. Add 1/4 tsp hing (asafetida), 1/2 tsp black pepper, 1 inch ginger (grated), 1 tsp sweetener (dates | maple syrup), some green chillies (to taste), 1/4 tsp pink salt (to taste), a few drops of lemon juice, 3-4 curry leaves (minced). Finally add 1 tsp ENO just before cooking the batter.\n\nROASTED MASALA\n- Dry roast mustard seeds, cumin seeds, curry leaves, sesame seeds and some crushed peanuts.\n\nDivide the batter into three equal portions.\n\n+ UTHAPAM STYLE HANDVO: Pour one portion of batter on non-stick pan. Prepare like uthapam. Garnish with roasted masala. Cook for 5 to 8 minutes on slow flame, covered with a lid. Then flip it over and cook for another 5 to 8 minutes.\n+ AIR FRIED HANDVO: Air fry the second portion of batter for 15 mins each side at 180 C\n+ MICROWAVED HANDVO: Pour the third portion of batter into mugs. Microwave for 3 mins.",
  "cooking_methods": [
    "no-cook",
    "blend",
    "roast",
    "saute",
    "air-fry",
    "microwave"
  ],
  "serving_suggestion": "Enjoy with Mint Chutney, Amla Chutney & plant-based yogurt!",
  "notes": "Use the juice squeezed from grated veggies as a vegetable broth for another recipe.",
